Package: combatrefql
Title: ComBat-refQL Reference-Batch Adjustment for RNA-Seq Counts
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Xiaoyu",
      "Zhang",
      role = "ctb",
      comment = "ComBat-ref method and original implementation"
    ),
    person("Thomas", "Sirchi", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "thomasirchi@gmail.com")
  )
Description: Provides a structured interface for adjusting raw RNA-seq counts
    toward a selected reference batch. The package uses current edgeR
    model-fitting infrastructure, quasi-likelihood-aware empirical-Bayes
    batch contrasts, hierarchical batch-specific negative-binomial dispersion,
    deterministic count transport, and validated S7 objects with tidy diagnostics.
